# With no planeswalker anywhere, Innovative Commons enters tapped (CR 614.1d) - the land itself is not a planeswalker - so it
# cannot be tapped for mana that turn (refused), and on Bot1's next turn it untaps and taps for {R}, the other of its colors.

[Bot1 Deck]
Innovative Commons
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Innovative Commons.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Innovative Commons.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Innovative Commons.Activate(Color: Red)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Innovative Commons.Activate(Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Innovative Commons.Tapped = true
